  - m_Id: 1777781751808
    m_Localized: Moonshiner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33510552027136
    m_Localized: Please select a starting specialization...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36113511923712
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, no particular specialization piqued your interest. Instead, you spent more time optimising your operation, resulting in less money spent setting up the store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36412188311552
    m_Localized: Increased starting Credit count
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38817957199872
    m_Localized: Recommended For New Players
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39721708077056
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Household Goods and Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39719812251648
    m_Localized: Additional equipment (Storage Bay)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41091349659648
    m_Localized: Work In Progress
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44792365760512
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you took a particular interest in learning about the Water trade. Clean water is a scarce resource on the station and there is money to be made by those with their hands on the tap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69123699425280
    m_Localized: Water Trading Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69167391490048
    m_Localized: Water Testing and Purification Equipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69177692700672
    m_Localized: Additional storage (Water Containers)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70344103477248
    m_Localized: Before The Mentor found you, you were a scavenger, poor but with solid reputation. Despite your training, you never forgot your past, and have even repurposed your old equipment for your new occupation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70401448001536
    m_Localized: Scavenger's Gear and Tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70434029355008
    m_Localized: Increased starting reputation (Scavengers)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70436172644352
    m_Localized: Additional equipment (Furnace)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72090364198912
    m_Localized: Advanced Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72394300243968
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you took a particular interest in contraband. You're an established black marketeer, and have even installed a hidden storage compartment in your store to avoid the prying of the station's security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73142996090880
    m_Localized: Additional equipment (Smuggler's Bay)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73278484692992
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Contraband
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73328950558720
    m_Localized: Increased starting reputation (Black Market)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73330057854976
    m_Localized: Decreased starting reputation (Security)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73331030933504
    m_Localized: Immediate access to the Janitor Underground Exchange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73389046546432
    m_Localized: Increased starting rent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74131299942400
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you developed a taste for moonshine. You know how to trade, appraise and even brew your own liquor. Moonshine is popular in the Lower Levels due to its low cost, but it is also unregulated and illegal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74164715962368
    m_Localized: Moonshine Trading Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74261122039808
    m_Localized: Moonshine Brewing Starter Kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74542706638848
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you acquired a nose for narcotics. You are an expert in the illegal, addictive and lucrative trade of controlled substances. You're not bad in the lab, either, should supply run low.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74698969628672
    m_Localized: Chemistry Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74729940369408
    m_Localized: Chemistry Lab Equipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75185236262912
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you developed a grim fascination in the trade of human organs. Certified, ethically sourced organs are legal to trade... but there is more money to be made in illicit stock harvested from living patients.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75262713446400
    m_Localized: Organ Trading Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75305663119360
    m_Localized: Additional equipment (Organ Storage Container)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75308548800512
    m_Localized: Blood Transfusion Set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75463129874432
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you took a particular interest in over-the-counter medicines. You learned about the basics of running a pharmacy, helping sick customers and synthesizing drugs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75501117685760
    m_Localized: Drug Trading Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75502254342144
    m_Localized: First Aid Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75503260975104
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Medical Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75997584867328
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you developed a passion for cooking and street food. You know how to prepare quick, flavorful meals that cater to the busy residents of the lower levels. Operating a street food stall is a popular and flexible way to make a living, and with the right ingredients, you can turn a tidy profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76052249231360
    m_Localized: Cooking Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76054665150464
    m_Localized: Additional equipment (Stove)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76056204460032
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Ingredients
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76194914287616
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you refined your knowledge of hydroponic farming, an efficient way to grow crops in the limited space available on the station. With your expertise, you can help feed the lower levels while making a handy profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76197867077632
    m_Localized: Hydroponic Farming Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76201893609472
    m_Localized: Additional equipment (Hydroponic Systems)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76203508416512
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Farming Supplies and Seeds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76509856186368
    m_Localized: Increased starting rent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16229462627368960
    m_Localized: Gunsmith
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16229510593429504
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you developed an enthusiasm for firearms and munitions. You learned how to modify weapons, from handmade sidearms to powerful machine guns. With a license in hand, you now fulfill custom orders and earn a steady income arming the residents of the station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16230746092781568
    m_Localized: Class I Weapon Permit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16230752501678080
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Firearms and Gun Mods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16230769882873856
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Ammunition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99065213836115968
    m_Localized: Rock Bottom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99069202615025664
    m_Localized: The Mentor didn't help you with anything aside from negotiating your lease with the Landlord. You have nothing but the Store, and a will to survive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99069229261438976
    m_Localized: None.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99069305866207232
    m_Localized: Extreme Challenge Mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 99670006883467264
    m_Localized: Corrupted Save
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108073004236062720
    m_Localized: Rat Wrangler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108073004273811456
    m_Localized: Animal Cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108073004273811457
    m_Localized: Rats
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108073004273811458
    m_Localized: Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108082834627674112
    m_Localized: To the Mentor's annoyance, you developed a great passion for animal ranching. Rats, more specifically. You've learned the basics of raising rats for meat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112700634117750784
    m_Localized: "You're a shopkeeper in the Lower Levels of a sprawling space station. Once a poor scavenger, you were taken in by a mysterious figure known as the Mentor, who fronted you a generous loan and taught you the basics of running a shop. His true motives remain unclear.\nNow you must meet the Landlord's unrelenting demands or face eviction. Turn a profit, secure a mortgage, and buy the shop to carve out your place on the station.\n Survive at any cost. Earn your future."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180521517629915136
    m_Localized: Aquafarmer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180521517629915137
    m_Localized: During your training with The Mentor, you learned to raise fish in tanks for meat. You start with a small recirculating system and a stock of starter fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180521517629915138
    m_Localized: Recirculating Aquaculture Systems
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180521517629915139
    m_Localized: Start with a stock of Tilapia and Fish Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 180521517629915140
    m_Localized: Increased starting rent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
